{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1000_p", "source_sha256": "22f98e7181658d50214d63e7e3e0bbee58da21aafcc035c07521719d64d194ec", "ja": "（歩とこのみさんが、クリスマスのスペシャルドラマへ\n出演する！　撮影開始まで、少し時間があったが……）", "zh": "（步和木实小姐要出演圣诞特别电视剧！距离开始拍摄还有一点时间，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f67cb1c9ee59a684ef8129a78adbdea0b403cac7dd9b1412919894ff6e7c6437", "ja": "このみさんのプレゼント、すごいうれしいよ！\nアタシが選ばないような大人っぽいチョイスでさ。", "zh": "好美姐的礼物，我真的特别开心！\n是那种我自己不会选的成熟风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "ca73f4f11efed0bc1cb1af0816505f4dd05d20bcf486a71d0c28003b427d5c90", "ja": "ふふ、ありがとう。けど、歩ちゃんのもすごく素敵よ。\nデザインも、とっても可愛いし！", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢。不过，步的礼物也特别棒哦。\n设计也非常可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b68717ec595afb4ae44c6cd1a1c36d031424ad517725c2dd5720ef66158147b2", "ja": "お疲れさま、二人共。\nなんだか楽しそうですね？", "zh": "辛苦了，你们两个。\n看起来好像很开心呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d6219ba2192d12ed3b38861eca86d679f4c5d6ed400180812357957ff89f3cef", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！\nこのみさんから、クリスマスプレゼントもらったんだ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n我从这个美小姐那里收到了圣诞礼物！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ac34464d9804323d8374b2a4f2d7128623585174bef6ec466c9047fe9bc7420c", "ja": "これは……ネイル？\nクリスマスプレゼントって……？", "zh": "这是……指甲油？\n圣诞礼物……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "665481c04bc59a04839aeb70c4706e93fa5b2918572ba3ee5589bba9b5cf2c0b", "ja": "クリスマスがテーマの撮影だから、\n何か楽しいことがしたいねって、二人で話してたの。", "zh": "因为是以圣诞节为主题的拍摄，\n我们两个人就聊着说，想做点开心的事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "fbe3630591f4833e633e382ec4b66595988bcb03e3824aaa4f9862268a5ad335", "ja": "私は、素敵なタオルを貰っちゃった♪\nとっても肌触りがいいのよ、これ。うふふ。", "zh": "我收到了一条很棒的毛巾♪摸起来特别舒服呢，呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1008_p", "source_sha256": "462932453d6c5df1145151fc6aeb0c093c5b42baa018cdeae01ea902d65c5d16", "ja": "おお。良いものを貰いましたね、このみさん。", "zh": "哦，收到好东西了呢，木实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ee78e0a1cc8f8cfd2bc876dacca8534ade0e8eaf8718ef296cfd943800fa572c", "ja": "へへ、よかった。このみさんってオシャレだからさ。\nアタシも気合い入れて選んだんだ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了。因为可爱姐很时髦嘛。\n我也是打起精神来精心挑选的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2d94b254b3fd0529f9d3b754e7cfdc8f11fddcfa4ebeaf5aa97f901e3142b477", "ja": "タオルなら普段使いできるしね。家で使うのもいい\nけど、せっかくだし、レッスンの時に使ってよ！", "zh": "毛巾的话平时也能用嘛。在家里用也不错，  \n不过难得有这个机会，练习的时候就用它吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "bcce12240a347d852961fc040e64d1464e3caf8c6558eb7a8cc54685420a4236", "ja": "ええ、そうするわ♪　私のために、一生懸命\n選んでくれてありがとう、歩ちゃん！", "zh": "嗯，我会这么做♪　谢谢你为了我这么用心地挑选，步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "bf07d3d09b4f334a9f1fb48fcad0dff455928b9113c7cf2fb752241b9e8dbbb2", "ja": "ちなみに……私も、かなり気合を入れて選んだのよ？\nあれでもない、これでもないって、ずっと探してね。", "zh": "顺便说一句……我也是相当认真地挑选的哦？\n这个不行，那个也不行，一直找了好久呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6419a3a657d138df4c485d76908ba00a5c2861eaa24dc972c917704952c5a801", "ja": "それで歩にネイルを。\n……あれ？　そのネイルって、もしかして。", "zh": "所以给步做了美甲。\n……咦？这个美甲，难道是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "ab3caf490743fe88961be697062d975a8663f61ff06c7851aa48761420e6ece5", "ja": "あら、気づいた？　うふふ。\n実はこのネイル、私もプライベートで使ってるの。", "zh": "哎呀，你发现啦？呵呵。\n其实这款美甲，我私下也在用哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1f9c27b283562ff9d68b73a9753cbe45bb628e150ac4f5f7097c92550ebf7f73", "ja": "そうなの！？\n……ってことは、このみさんとお揃いじゃん！", "zh": "是这样吗！？\n……也就是说，这和木实姐的是同款嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "6837a2c8b129749630e66f014da52085602996592480208e85c1b267cb1e7189", "ja": "ええ。せっかくのプレゼントだし、お揃いっていうのも\n悪くないかなって。もしかして、お揃いはイヤだった？", "zh": "嗯。难得是份礼物，和你用同款好像也不错。难道你不想和我用同款？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "346a0308c9742d6ad7cb17d84d5a632e011dc1be92a9964316b6b7328be04512", "ja": "ううん、そんなことないよ！　むしろ、すっごく\n嬉しい！　そっか、このみさんとお揃い……。", "zh": "没有的事，才不会呢！倒不如说，我超级\n高兴的！这样啊，和木实小姐同款……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ef7009b55965b82cfa33b5186c94c509ee1301eb64f613dadd47e79e6cb209a6", "ja": "あ、そうだ！　{$P$}、\nこの後の撮影、このネイル付けてもいいかな？", "zh": "啊，对了！{$P$}，接下来的拍摄，我可以戴这个美甲吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c55af5b049454295936d56755204cc8f008cf9de6da304172db87473afe2ede0", "ja": "ん？　そうだな、スタッフさんに確認してみるけど、\n大丈夫だと思うよ。衣装にもピッタリだし。", "zh": "嗯？是啊，我去跟工作人员确认一下，不过应该没问题。和服装也很搭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "da2788b5c2c0e8a68a1f378b352dbe531e894e729d136b13b0094db0f37c8282", "ja": "サンキュー！　このみさんのネイルをしたら、\n息ピッタリの演技ができるかなって思ってさ！", "zh": "谢谢！我想着，做了木实姐的美甲，说不定就能演出配合得天衣无缝的戏了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "ed127ffdc842052c35b833b29f508b00554d3e54aac6810c7b56611bb1578fba", "ja": "ふふ♪　それじゃあせっかくだし……歩ちゃんに\n綺麗な塗り方、レクチャーしちゃうわね！", "zh": "呵呵♪ 既然难得有这个机会……我来教小步漂亮的涂指甲方法吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0504_1022_p", "source_sha256": "24901753909260dedba78e76ca66a8b639ddb93211c3a191c6dc75526b4bf77f", "ja": "（その後、臨んだふたりの撮影は、歩の言う通り、\n息ピッタリの演技でバッチリだった……！）", "zh": "（之后，两人的拍摄正如步所说，凭借配合得天衣无缝的演技顺利完成了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
